              "599": [
                "The commodity group SITC 599 is new from year 2007.For the years 1995-2006 the table shows 0 in value."
              ],
              "891": [
                "Statistics in commodity group Arms and Ammunition (SITC 891, SPIN 29.6, 29.60 and 29.600) must be interpreted with care. It is not to be used as an estimate on Swedish trade in goods for military and defence use. Included in the commodity group are both arms and ammunition for civilian as military use. Not included in the commodity group are Aircrafts, ships, vehicles, search- and measuring systems etc. for military use. The commodity group therefore consists of only a small amount in what is considered as goods for military and defence use. Complete statistics on goods for military and defence use is provided by Swedish Agency for Non-proliferation and Export controls (ISP)."
              ]
